//// set: pk-p20 — 空范围的推导式、der 的零长数组实参、组件修饰里推导式的范围、向量化调用的派生标量输入（求值了也留函数，未做 → SKIP）
//// model: PKL1
model PKL1
  parameter Integer n = 2;
  parameter Integer np = 3;
  Real x[n] = {time, 2 * time};
  Real w[n];
equation
  w[2:n - 1] = {x[i] * 2 for i in 2:n - 1} * np;
  w[1] = x[1];
  w[n] = x[n];
end PKL1;
//// model: PKL2
model PKL2
  parameter Integer n = 0;
  Real x[3] = {time, 2 * time, 3};
  Real y[n] = {x[i] for i in 1:n};
  Real s = sum({x[i] for i in 1:n}) + time;
  Real m = max({x[i] for i in 1:n});
end PKL2;
//// model: PKL3
model PKL3
  parameter Integer n = 0;
  parameter Real p[n] = {2.0 * i for i in 1:n};
  Real z = time;
end PKL3;
//// model: PKL4
model PKL4
  parameter Integer nX = 0;
  parameter Integer n = 2;
  Real m[n, nX];
  Real f[n, nX];
  Real u[n];
equation
  for i in 1:n loop
    der(m[i, :]) = f[i, :];
    der(u[i]) = -u[i];
  end for;
  for i in 1:n loop
    f[i, :] = zeros(nX);
  end for;
end PKL4;
//// model: PKL5
model PKL5
  parameter Integer nX = 0;
  Real m[nX];
  Real f[nX];
  Real u;
equation
  der(m) = f;
  der(m[:]) = f[1:nX];
  der(u) = -u + sum(m);
end PKL5;
//// model: PKL6
model PKL6
  parameter Real Ptable[:] = {1, 2, 3};
  parameter Real Itable[:] = {4, 5, 6};
  model T
    parameter Real table[:, :];
    Real y = table[1, 1] * time;
  end T;
  T t(table = {{Ptable[j], Itable[j]} for j in 1:size(Ptable, 1)});
end PKL6;
//// model: PKL7
model PKL7
  parameter Real Ptable[:] = {1, 2, 3};
  parameter Real q[:] = {2 * Ptable[j] for j in 1:size(Ptable, 1)};
  Real y = q[2] * time;
end PKL7;
//// model: PKL8
model PKL8
  function f
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end f;
  parameter Real wtable[:] = f({1500, 1496});
  Real y = wtable[1] * time;
end PKL8;
//// model: PKL9
model PKL9
  function f
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end f;
  parameter Real wtable[:] = f({1500, 1496});
  model T
    parameter Real table[:, :];
    Real y = table[1, 1] * time;
  end T;
  T t(table = {{wtable[j], 1} for j in 1:size(wtable, 1)});
end PKL9;
//// model: PKL10
model PKL10
  function f
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end f;
  parameter Real wtable[2] = f({1500, 1496});
  Real y = wtable[1] * time;
end PKL10;
//// model: PKL11
model PKL11
  function g
    input Real x[:];
    output Real y[size(x, 1)];
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  parameter Real wtable[:] = g({1500, 1496});
  Real y = wtable[1] * time;
end PKL11;
//// model: PKL12
package P12
  function from_rpm
    input Real rpm;
    output Real rs;
  algorithm
    rs := 0.1 * rpm;
  end from_rpm;
end P12;
model PKL12
  import P12.from_rpm;
  parameter Real wtable[:] = from_rpm({1500, 1496});
  Real y = wtable[1] * time;
end PKL12;
//// model: PKL13
package P13
  function from_rpm
    input Real rpm;
    output Real rs;
  algorithm
    rs := 0.1 * rpm;
  end from_rpm;
end P13;
model PKL13
  import P13.from_rpm;
  parameter Real Ptable[:] = {1, 2};
  parameter Real wtable[:] = from_rpm({1500, 1496});
  model T
    parameter Real table[:, :];
    Real y = table[1, 1] * time;
  end T;
  T t(table = {{Ptable[j], wtable[j]} for j in 1:size(Ptable, 1)});
end PKL13;
//// model: PKL14
package P14
  function from_rpm
    input Real rpm;
    output Real rs;
  algorithm
    rs := 0.1 * rpm;
  end from_rpm;
end P14;
model PKL14
  import P14.from_rpm;
  parameter Real w0 = from_rpm(1462.5);
  parameter Real wtable[:] = from_rpm({1500, 1496});
  Real y = wtable[1] * time;
end PKL14;
//// model: PKL15
package P15
  type Rpm = Real(final quantity = "AngularVelocity", final unit = "rev/min");
  function from_rpm
    input Rpm rpm;
    output Real rs;
  algorithm
    rs := 0.1 * rpm;
  end from_rpm;
end P15;
model PKL15
  import P15.from_rpm;
  parameter Real wtable[:] = from_rpm({1500, 1496});
  Real y = wtable[1] * time;
end PKL15;
